Hi Vincent, Marvin, and Will,

We=E2=80=99re looking forward to welcoming you to Brown as spectators for IIC=
 on November 5=E2=80=936!

You will be traveling with a separate driver from the Cornell Financial Analy=
sts participants. Your driver will reach out today with pickup details and tr=
avel arrangements. We will reimburse the driver for gas and mileage. Please c=
oordinate directly with your driver on pickup and timing.

Hotel: The Graduate
11 Dorrance Street, Providence, RI 02903
Check-in: Thursday, November 5 at 12:00 PM (noon) ET
Check-out: Friday, November 6 at 9:00 AM ET

Please bring your student ID for check-in when you arrive. Feel free to reply=
 if you have any questions. We look forward to seeing you tomorrow!

Best,
The IIC Team

